 s of Dolly Parton’s life and legacy. Crockett is joining the celebration
  and turning its monthl y Friday evening event\, Night Trip – into – D
 OLLYCON – a free\, joyful tribute to Dolly Parton’s life\, music\, mov
 ies\, style and spirit. Pomona Street businesses will stay open late with 
 vendor pop-ups\, music\, and surprises. Guests are encouraged to come dres
 sed as Dolly or someone from Dolly World . Best Dressed wins a pair of cus
 tomized one/one coveralls provided by Monarch Store. For one September nig
 ht\, this historic small town under the bridge becomes a love letter to Do
 lly . DOLLYCON — Friday\, September 25 | 6–11 PM Pomona Street @ 1st &
  2nd | Crockett\, CA 94525 | Free
